Description: SupraLINUX Aurora Ubuntu LTS base metapackage
 Development metapackage defining the non-desktop platform baseline for
 SupraLINUX Aurora on Ubuntu 26.04 LTS.
 .
 It intentionally contains no Ubuntu Desktop, GNOME, Kubuntu desktop, Snap,
 or SupraLINUX visual/application layer.
